{
  "_description": "Mock service-banner dataset used to benchmark the offline CVE lookup engine. Every entry is a synthetic/lab banner string paired with the CVE ID it should resolve to. This is NOT live internet data — it is a fixture for local QA testing per the project's Safety & Authorization Boundaries policy.",
